window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>My name is Lux Weston, and I’m a matter of national security... apparently.</b></p> <p>All I did was meet a beautiful girl in a bookstore and then rescue her. Once… twice… and maybe a third time—from a creeper.</p> <p>The problem? The creeper turned out to be Secret Service, and the girl… well, she’s Radley Andrews—the President’s only daughter.</p> <p>It has disaster written all over it. I should stay away.</p> <p>She’s a student, I’m a Major League Baseball player. She’s trying to hide from the spotlight, I’m standing underneath it. Not to mention I’ve never had a relationship, and Radley has her own demons to battle.</p> <p>When she starts looking at me the way I’m looking at her, staying away becomes impossible. Soon we’re sneaking secret dates and I’m making her breakfast.</p> <p>While Radley might be the most beautiful girl I’ve ever seen, she’s become something better: mine.</p>"; 
